5,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm the Seer! I'll check someone tonight. Who should I look at first?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I suggest we observe Asuka first. Her calm demeanor seems too calculated for a simple villager.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Toshio. Asuka's silence is suspicious. Let's focus on her.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I find it amusing you target me so quickly. My silence is merely observation, not guilt.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
