14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Agreed. Rushing is for amateurs. Let’s wait for the Seer’s data. I’ll be watching you all, @Rin.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shion"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shion: Agreed. Rushing is for amateurs. Let’s wait for the Seer’s data. I’ll be watching you all, @Rin.""}]}"
